Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:07:43 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] yami: main thread at realtime priority

SCHED_RR 1 with SCHED_RESET_ON_FORK when allowed (RLIMIT_RTPRIO or
CAP_SYS_NICE), so a game loading every core doesn't make the desktop
stutter. Capabilities are dropped right after. YAMI_NIRI_RT=0 turns it
off.
